    "che_che_jr_0327": "2H2O",
    "che_che_jr_0328": "实验结论：蜡烛燃烧生成了水（烧杯内壁有水雾）和二氧化碳（石灰水变浑浊）。化学反应方程式：C25H52 + 33O2 =点燃= 25CO2 + 26H2O；CO2 + Ca(OH)2 = CaCO3↓ + H2O。",
    "che_che_jr_0329": "C",
    "che_che_jr_0330": "C",
    "che_che_jr_0331": "纯 CaCO3 质量 = 100 × 90% = 90 g。CaCO3 + 2HCl = CaCl2 + H2O + CO2↑。设 CO2 质量为 x：100/44 = 90/x，x = 90 × 44 / 100 = 39.6 g。设 CaCl2 质量为 y：100/111 = 90/y，y = 90 × 111 / 100 = 99.9 g。答：生成 CO2 39.6 g，CaCl2 99.9 g。",
    "che_che_jr_0332": "A",
    "che_che_jr_0333": "B",
    "che_che_jr_0334": "A",
    "che_che_jr_0335": "C",
    "che_che_jr_0336": "纯 CaCO3 质量 = 200 × 90% = 180 t。CaCO3 =高温= CaO + CO2↑。设 CaO 质量为 x：100/56 = 180/x，x = 180 × 56 / 100 = 100.8 t。设 CO2 质量为 y：100/44 = 180/y，y = 180 × 44 / 100 = 79.2 t。答：生成 CaO 100.8 t，CO2 79.2 t。",
    "che_che_jr_0337": "B",
    "che_che_jr_0338": "纯 H2SO4 质量 = 100 × 9.8% = 9.8 g。Fe + H2SO4 = FeSO4 + H2↑。设 FeSO4 质量为 x：98/152 = 9.8/x，x = 9.8 × 152 / 98 = 15.2 g。答：生成 FeSO4 15.2 g。",
